Agent-Jev
Copyright 2026 Jiaju Chen and Agent-Jev contributors

An independent toolkit for decoder-based decision readout and supervised
fine-tuning. Inspired by TypeSafe Jev's typed decision interface and prior
single-pass decision work including Mapika/decider. Not affiliated with or
endorsed by TypeSafe AI, Qwen, or the Decider project.

No third-party model weights or research datasets are included.
